      "start_seconds": 5.2,
      "end_seconds": 11.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, morning, doctor, sorry about the rush"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.22,
      "end_seconds": 13.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.1,
      "end_seconds": 30.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.13,
      "text": "Well, um, I've been having flakes on my shoulders. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.08,
      "end_seconds": 35.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.74,
      "end_seconds": 48.12,
      "duration_seconds": 11.38,
      "text": "Hmm, hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.35,
      "end_seconds": 52.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Is it a lot or only a little?"
