    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.78,
      "end_seconds": 56.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.75,
      "end_seconds": 62.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.52,
      "end_seconds": 72.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "Ah, it usually comes with an itchy scalp. The itchy scalp? That's been for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.79,
      "end_seconds": 77.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.11,
      "end_seconds": 80.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "My son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.53,
      "end_seconds": 90.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.05,
      "end_seconds": 102.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "Sodium valproate. I take it 500 milligrams, twice a day. I take an anti-dandruff shampoo, twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.01,
      "end_seconds": 123.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.16,
      "end_seconds": 125.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "I have epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.24,
      "end_seconds": 131.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Alright, epilepsy, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.13,
      "end_seconds": 144.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "how are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.26,
      "end_seconds": 150.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.01,
      "end_seconds": 154.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.04,
      "end_seconds": 159.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.61,
      "end_seconds": 161.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.87,
      "end_seconds": 168.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.21,
      "end_seconds": 171.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.6,
      "end_seconds": 177.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Just my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.53,
      "end_seconds": 181.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "And what about hair loss, pus or pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.04,
      "end_seconds": 187.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "No, no hair loss, pus or pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.13,
      "end_seconds": 191.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "And rash elsewhere, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.1,
      "end_seconds": 199.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "No, none, no rash elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.27,
      "end_seconds": 202.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.96,
      "end_seconds": 207.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "that's normal as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.99,
      "end_seconds": 211.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.43,
      "end_seconds": 224.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.52,
      "end_seconds": 244.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 14, BP is 123 over 74, temp 36.9 degrees, pulse is 85 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.25,
      "end_seconds": 248.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.9,
      "end_seconds": 251.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.47,
      "end_seconds": 256.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.89,
      "end_seconds": 259.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.7,
      "end_seconds": 273.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "There is fine greasy scaling across the scalp with no bald patches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.65,
      "end_seconds": 278.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.07,
      "end_seconds": 306.64,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, it fits best with simple dandruff. It could also be seborrhoeic dermatitis, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.21,
      "end_seconds": 312.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "hmm, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.63,
      "end_seconds": 327.13,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like simple dandruff. Leave the shampoo on for five minutes before rinsing. We'll catch up if not better in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.91,
      "end_seconds": 331.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.98,
      "end_seconds": 335.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.38,
      "end_seconds": 338.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
